# Email signature quality score
SignatureQuality=Calitate semnătură
SignatureQualityExcellent=Excelentă
SignatureQualityGood=Bună
SignatureQualityFair=Acceptabilă
SignatureQualityPoor=Slabă
SignatureQualityDetails=Vizualizează bunele practici pentru îmbunătățire
SignatureQualityNoIssue=Această semnătură respectă bunele practici uzuale în comunicarea prin email.
SignatureQualityTooltip=Scor calculat pe baza bunelor practici uzuale de email pentru semnăturile HTML (echilibrul dintre text și imagini, link-uri absolute, text alternativ, dimensiune...).
SignatureCheckContent=Conținut semnătură
SignatureAdviceContent=Semnătura nu conține aproape deloc text. Adaugă cel puțin numele complet, funcția și o modalitate de a te contacta.
SignatureCheckScriptTag=Cod script
SignatureAdviceScriptTag=Remove any script tag: mail clients block it and it flags the message as spam.
SignatureCheckStyleBlock=Style block or external stylesheet
SignatureAdviceStyleBlock=Move styling into inline style attributes; style tags and external CSS are stripped by many webmail clients.
SignatureCheckNonAbsoluteUrl=Non absolute image or link URL
SignatureAdviceNonAbsoluteUrl=Use full https:// URLs. Relative, http:// or cid: references are broken once the mail leaves Dolibarr.
SignatureCheckTextImageRatio=Text to image balance
SignatureAdviceTextImageRatio=Add real text (name, role, contact details). A signature made mostly of images disappears when images are blocked.
SignatureCheckImageCount=Number of images
SignatureAdviceImageCount=Keep to a logo and, at most, a small strip of social icons.
SignatureCheckImageAlt=Image alternative text
SignatureAdviceImageAlt=Set an alt attribute on every image so it degrades gracefully when images are turned off.
SignatureCheckImageWeight=Image weight
SignatureAdviceImageWeight=Avoid inline base64 images and oversized widths; host the logo and link to it instead.
SignatureCheckLinkCount=Number of links
SignatureAdviceLinkCount=Too many links looks like spam. Keep only the essential ones.
SignatureCheckTextLength=Text length
SignatureAdviceTextLength=Shorten the signature to a few lines.
SignatureCheckContactInfo=Contact details
SignatureAdviceContactInfo=Add a reachable email (mailto:) or phone (tel:) link.
SignatureCheckFixedWidth=Fixed layout width
SignatureAdviceFixedWidth=Avoid fixed widths above the recommended size; they break the layout on mobile.
